Package: rasch
Type: Package
Title: Models and Diagnostics for Rasch Measurement Theory
Version: 1.14.2
Authors@R: person("Josh", "McGrane", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "drjoshmcgrane@gmail.com")
Description: Pairwise conditional estimation (Zwinderman, 1995
    <doi:10.1177/014662169501900406>) for the models of Rasch Measurement
    Theory (Rasch, 1960 <ISBN:9780226705538>): the dichotomous and
    polytomous Rasch models, many-facet models, the extended frame of
    reference model, and comparative judgement models for dichotomous and
    polytomous pairwise comparisons. Provides fit and invariance
    diagnostics, differential item functioning analysis, equating,
    reliability, and simulation, with person measurement by weighted
    likelihood (Warm, 1989 <doi:10.1007/BF02294627>), following the
    framework of Andrich and Marais (2019) <doi:10.1007/978-981-13-7496-8>.
    Includes a point-and-click 'shiny' app that includes the full
    functionality of the package.
URL: https://drjoshmcgrane.github.io/rasch/, https://github.com/drjoshmcgrane/rasch
BugReports: https://github.com/drjoshmcgrane/rasch/issues
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
